	"readme": "# postcss-theme-provider\r\n\r\nProduction-ready theme engine for PostCSS.\r\n\r\nDefine themes once with `@theme` syntax and automatically generate:\r\n\r\n- CSS custom properties\r\n- TypeScript definitions\r\n- JSON theme exports\r\n- Tailwind-compatible configs\r\n- Interactive documentation\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npnpm add -D postcss postcss-theme-provider\r\n```\r\n\r\nCLI is included (`theme` binary):\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npnpm exec theme --help\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Quick example\r\n\r\n```css\r\n@theme light {\r\n  primary: #2563eb;\r\n  background: white;\r\n  foreground: black;\r\n  radius: 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@theme dark extends light {\r\n  primary: #60a5fa;\r\n  background: #111827;\r\n  foreground: white;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport theme from \"postcss-theme-provider\";\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n  plugins: [\r\n    theme({\r\n      defaultTheme: \"light\",\r\n      attribute: \"data-theme\",\r\n      generateTypes: true,\r\n      generateJSON: true,\r\n      generateDocs: true,\r\n      generateTailwindConfig: true,\r\n      validateColors: true,\r\n    }),\r\n  ],\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n\r\n```css\r\n:root {\r\n  --primary: #2563eb;\r\n  --background: white;\r\n  --foreground: black;\r\n  --radius: 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\r\n  --primary: #60a5fa;\r\n  --background: #111827;\r\n  --foreground: white;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Unlimited themes\r\n- Nested token groups (`colors.primary` → `--colors-primary`)\r\n- Theme inheritance with override-only emission\r\n- Validation with filename/line/column, code frames, and suggestions\r\n- CLI: `build`, `watch`, `validate`, `docs`, `json`, `types`, `doctor`\r\n- Incremental compilation cache for large projects\r\n- Dual ESM + CommonJS builds\r\n\r\n## Use from a local checkout\r\n\r\nIn another project:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npnpm add -D postcss \"file:/absolute/path/to/postcss-theme\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nOr in that project's `package.json`:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n\"devDependencies\": {\r\n  \"postcss-theme-provider\": \"file:../postcss-theme\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nBuild this package first (`pnpm build`) so `dist/` exists.\r\n\r\n## Scripts\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npnpm build\r\npnpm test\r\npnpm test:coverage\r\npnpm lint\r\npnpm docs:dev\r\npnpm playground:dev\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\nSee [`examples/`](./examples) for Vite, React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, and Astro.\r\n\r\n## Documentation\r\n\r\n- Local docs: `pnpm docs:dev`\r\n- Guide topics: installation, syntax, CLI, configuration, migration, FAQ\r\n\r\n## License\r\n\r\nMIT\r\n",
